 ploads/event/2026TPAB%20Mobilize%20%2820%29_20260403223247628809.png
DESCRIPTION:Community Organizing is the key to winning campaigns. But some
  of the most effective organizing is happening in places that are often ov
 erlooked\, like retirement communities. Join Turn PA Blue for our conversa
 tion with Stella Sexton\, Vice Chair of the Lancaster Dems\, about how the
 y have turned organizing in retirement communities into a powerful tool fo
 r winning elections in Lancaster County. You’ll hear from elected offici
 als\, community organizers\, and local volunteers about what’s working o
 n t
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/turnpablue/event/933335/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
